listed T at $1^L$. Define $Z_f,U_f$ by the following rows; all A vanish.

| Word | P in $Z_f$ | C in $Z_f$ | P in $U_f$ | C in $U_f$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| $00100$ | $0$ | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ |
| $01000$ | $0$ | $0$ | $18$ | $0$ |
| $01010$ | $0$ | $0$ | $2$ | $0$ |
